Description: Provides taxon-resolved analysis of functional profiles predicted
    by 'PICRUSt2'. Integrates stratified functional contribution tables with
    'phyloseq' data for bidirectional differential analysis of taxonomic and
    functional contributions. Supports taxonomic aggregation, KEGG Orthology,
    Enzyme Commission and MetaCyc annotations, and visualization using Sankey
    diagrams, chord diagrams, boxplots, dendrograms and effect-size plots.
BugReports: https://github.com/bioscinema/MicroFun_0.1.0/issues
